score. Move 70 has been written in and crossed out, leaving something like
"K-B2" though this is not legal. In order to make the rest of the game vaguely
comprehensible, we have to allow the White king two moves here. I can't see
where the earlier score has gone wrong. So...} 70. Kg1 -- 71. Kf2 Kf4 72. Nd2 {
